  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Partition**: Players split 7 cards into Hand A (3 cards), Hand B (3 cards), and 1 Muck card. 2. **Vying**: Standard Brag betting follows. Players choose to play 'Blind' (before seeing the 7 cards) or 'See'. 3. **Ranks**: Prial > Running Flush > Run > Flush > Pair > High Card.",
    Player: "1. **Partition**: Players split 7 cards into Hand A (3 cards), Hand B (3 cards), and 1 Muck card. 2. **Vying**: Standard Brag betting follows. Players choose to play 'Blind' (before seeing the 7 cards) or 'See'. 3. **Ranks**: Prial > Running Flush > Run > Flush > Pair > High Card.",
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest-ranked hands across the partition or by forcing others to fold.',
    gameplay: "1. **Partition**: Players split 7 cards into Hand A (3 cards), Hand B (3 cards), and 1 Muck card. 2. **Vying**: Standard Brag betting follows. Players choose to play 'Blind' (before seeing the 7 cards) or 'See'. 3. **Ranks**: Prial > Running Flush > Run > Flush > Pair > High Card.",
    keyRules: [
      'Both three-card hands must be legal Brag combinations.',
      'In many house rules, a player must win both comparisons to sweep the pot.',
      'A Seeing player bets double the cost of a Blind player.',
