    turnFlow: "1. **Partition**: Players split 7 cards into Hand A (3 cards), Hand B (3 cards), and 1 Muck card. 2. **Vying**: Standard Brag betting follows. Players choose to play 'Blind' (before seeing the 7 cards) or 'See'. 3. **Ranks**: Prial > Running Flush > Run > Flush > Pair > High Card.",
    moveValidityConditions: {
      ante: 'Allowed only during the ante phase.',
