      buy_market: 'Players cannot purchase cards from a market; hand optimization is restricted to the initial partition.',
      buy_stock: 'There is no drawing or buying from the stock during play; the round uses the seven cards dealt at the start.',
      fold: 'Allowed during the vying phase when facing a bet.',
