      call: 'Allowed only during the vying phase.',
      bet: 'Seeing players must bet at least double the Blind bet amount.',
      raise: 'Allowed during the vying phase.',
      declare: 'Hand results are established during the showdown comparison rather than through a separate declaration.',
      reveal_hand: "The system automatically reveals partitions at the request of a player who pays the 'See' double-cost.",
