      play_card: '7-Card Brag is a partition vying game where cards are held rather than played to tricks.',
      draw: 'All seven cards are received at the start; no drawing phase exists during the play of the hand.',
      discard: 'Mandatory to complete the Hand A and Hand B partition.',
      pass: 'Players must either bet, see, or fold during their turn; a simple pass is not supported.',
